meta {
  name: Verify phone
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/phone/verify
  body: json
}

body:json {
  {
    "code": "000000"
  }
}

docs {
  The step registration is incomplete without. A correct code marks the number
  verified and moves the account from **Pending** to **Active**.

  Locally the code is in `storage/logs/laravel.log`. Three wrong guesses burn
  the code and a new one must be requested from **Resend code**.
}
